  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"743\">\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"680\">\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"680\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"608\">etected:</strong> Presence of Vancomycin-Resistant Enterococci colonization or infection.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"743\">\n<p data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"743\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"700\">Not Detected:</strong> No evidence of VRE in the tested specimen.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"778\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"778\">Clinical Utility:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"900\">\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"900\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Used to screen for <strong data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"830\">colonization or infection</strong> by VRE, especially in <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"899\">hospitalized or immunocompromised patients</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"917\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Important for:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"991\">\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"991\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"943\">Infection control</strong> and isolation protocols in healthcare settings.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1033\">\n<p data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1033\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Monitoring <strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1032\">antibiotic resistance</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1098\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Preventing <strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1070\">nosocomial spread</strong> in ICU or transplant units.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
